    "text": "If $\\mathrm{p}=\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}1 & \\alpha & 3 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 4\\end{array}\\right]$ is the adjoint of the $3 \\times 3$ matrix $\\mathrm{A}$ and $\\operatorname{det} \\mathrm{A}=4$, then $\\alpha$ is equal to"
